{
  "key": "production/synthwave",
  "kind": "production",
  "summary": "80s synth production: gated-reverb snare, chorus on everything, bright analog pads, wide and glossy",
  "tags": [
    "synthwave",
    "80s",
    "retro",
    "gated reverb",
    "chorus",
    "neon",
    "glossy"
  ],
  "devices": [
    "Reverb",
    "DattorroReverb",
    "Gate",
    "Delay"
  ],
  "links": [
    "genre/synthwave",
    "genre/synth-pop",
    "chain/gated-room",
    "chain/chorus"
  ],
  "checked": {
    "how": "written",
    "by": "claude (genre write-ups)",
    "date": "2026-11-12",
    "opendaw": "652e6ca"
  },
  "body": [
    "Gated reverb on the snare: a big short room cut off abruptly.",
    "Chorus and stereo width on pads, bass and leads; bright, little saturation; delays in 8ths or dotted 8ths.",
    "Apply: chain/gated-room on the drums and chain/chorus on the keys. Pads and the brightness are left to you."
  ],
  "apply": {
    "params": {
      "drums": {
        "type": "track",
        "optional": true,
        "about": "the drum track"
      },
      "keys": {
        "type": "track",
        "optional": true,
        "about": "a synth or keys part"
      },
      "amount": {
        "type": "amount"
      }
    },
    "steps": [
      {
        "op": "entry",
        "key": "chain/gated-room",
        "args": {
          "track": "$drums",
          "amount": "$amount"
        },
        "when": "drums"
      },
      {
        "op": "entry",
        "key": "chain/chorus",
        "args": {
          "track": "$keys",
          "amount": "$amount"
        },
        "when": "keys"
      }
    ]
  }
}
